<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29893" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑβδομ-αῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>on the seventh day</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱδρώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					4.36
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. πυρετός</span> a fever
				<i>recurring every seven days</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.24
			</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. τραγῳδοί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Hist.Conscr.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			: with a Verb, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διεφθείροντο ἑβδομαῖοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.49
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.3.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Galb.</u>
				7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑ. ἡμέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					6.690
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(i/ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>seven days old</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τράγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Horap.
					1.48
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑβδομ-αῖον</span></b> , τό, monthly festival of Apollo, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1357
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑβδομαγέτης</span>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				687
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				4
			</span></i> (Chios, <span class="entity">vii/vi B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				726.6
			</span></i> (Milet., <span class="entity">v B. C.</span>).</div>
